<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 18:11:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>晨光中的美丽入侵花</title><link>https://some.pics/6a77712988f25</link><description>&lt;p&gt;清晨光线中的喜马拉雅凤仙花。我知道它是入侵物种，但还是忍不住觉得它很美。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Tall purple flowers of Himalayan balsam sparkle in the early morning sun among lush green undergrowth. The scene is framed by the trunk and branch of a tree. " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bsag/6a77712988f25.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bsag.some.pics"&gt;@bsag&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 18:11:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一闪一闪小星星</title><link>https://some.pics/6a77667872a43</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一闪一闪亮晶晶&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A heavily edited black-and-white photograph of a star-shaped leaf, with tiny drops of water clinging to its edges, forming a sparkling star. " height="2780" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a77667872a43.jpg" width="2435"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 17:25:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a776001d80b4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🍻 不，我还不要回家。哈。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="🍻 Nee, ik ga nog niet naar huis. Ha. " height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a776001d80b4.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 16:57:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a773d7e880dd</link><description>&lt;p&gt;灯光也非常棒，所以我拍了一张建筑物的照片。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Shot of skyscrapers during sunset. " height="3570" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mbjones/6a773d7e880dd.jpg" width="3029"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mbjones.some.pics"&gt;@mbjones&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 14:30:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a773bb3378b3</link><description>&lt;p&gt;昨晚带儿子去了市中心的科学博物馆。忍不住抓紧拍了一张我俩的合照。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Myself (the bearded one) with my wife (the beautiful one) with skyscrapers in the background. " height="2092" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mbjones/6a773bb3378b3.jpg" width="2092"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mbjones.some.pics"&gt;@mbjones&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 14:22:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>